# CLI output. `wiserone random|daily|all` writes generated pages here,
# and a stray `git add -A` used to sweep them into a commit. Nothing
# publishes this directory — document.yml deploys target/doc.
# docs/ holds the documentation; the CLI also writes its generated site
# there (pages, sitemap, logs), which stays untracked.
/docs/*.html
/docs/*.xml
/docs/logs/
/output/
